Subject: [PATCH 01/15] feat(kv-cache): add provider-neutral compression
 lifecycle

Add the versioned compression configuration, worker compatibility contract, transactional scheduler lifecycle, and final-chunk handling for platform providers.

Keep the feature disabled by default and document the provider-neutral interface.

