From ff7733cce965ec28cb3087779e2ab8cf1aaf5d59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mhyzb <2372717433@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 07:27:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/15] feat(kv-cache): preserve prefix sharing during
 compression

Reserve private unhashed destination blocks, cap prefix hits for recomputation, and atomically replace request block tables after materialization.

Preserve the complete immutable source prefix for reuse by later requests.

