From: Mhyzb <2372717433@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 07:44:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/15] feat(kv-cache): correlate compression transactions
 under async scheduling

Fence final-prefill compression state until the matching async model-runner output commits it. Keep unrelated requests schedulable, exclude fenced requests from the pluggable victim selector, and discard stale output after abort or prefix reset.

